{
  "id": "E115",
  "title": "Where is my cellphone?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-05-14",
  "synopsis": "Who do you call when in need of help? Wang Li relies on her sister…",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/418/a9eb6e2cec98cb6630cbab82a33ab47f36819cee.mp3?1494265423",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我的手机呢？\n\n王丽：喂，姐，你在家吗？\n王苹：在家，有什么事吗？\n王丽：太好了！我忘了带钥匙，你能帮我送过来吗？\n王苹：你怎么又忘带钥匙？好吧，给你送到学校吗？\n王丽：不用，我还在公交车站等车。啊，我没带公交卡！姐……\n王苹：好好好，再帮你带上公交卡。\n王丽：谢谢姐！\n王苹：真怕你哪天把自己忘了。还有什么要带的吗？\n王丽：没有了。等等！我的手机呢？我好像忘记带手机了！\n王苹：那你现在用的是谁的手机？\n王丽：哦，我自己的……",
    "traditional": "我的手機呢？\n\n王麗：喂，姐，你在家嗎？\n王苹：在家，有什麼事嗎？\n王麗：太好了！我忘了帶鑰匙，你能幫我送過來嗎？\n王苹：你怎麼又忘帶鑰匙？好吧，給你送到學校嗎？\n王麗：不用，我還在公交車站等車。啊，我沒帶公交卡！姐……\n王苹：好好好，再幫你帶上公交卡。\n王麗：謝謝姐！\n王苹：真怕你哪天把自己忘了。還有什麼要帶的嗎？\n王麗：沒有了。等等！我的手機呢？我好像忘記帶手機了！\n王苹：那你現在用的是誰的手機？\n王麗：哦，我自己的……"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Where is my cellphone?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王丽：喂，姐，你在家吗？",
      "traditional": "王麗：喂，姐，你在家嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì wèi jiě nǐ zài jiā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Hello, sister, are you home?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "王苹：在家，有什么事吗？",
      "traditional": "王苹：在家，有什麼事嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng píng zài jiā yǒu shén me shì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ping: I’m home, what’s the matter?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王丽：太好了！我忘了带钥匙，你能帮我送过来吗？",
      "traditional": "王麗：太好了！我忘了帶鑰匙，你能幫我送過來嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì tài hǎo le wǒ wàng le dài yào shi nǐ néng bāng wǒ sòng guò lái ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Great! I forgot to take my key. Could you bring it to me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "王苹：你怎么又忘带钥匙？好吧，给你送到学校吗？",
      "traditional": "王苹：你怎麼又忘帶鑰匙？好吧，給你送到學校嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng píng nǐ zěn me yòu wàng dài yào shi hǎo ba gěi nǐ sòng dào xué xiào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ping: How could you forget your key again? Ok, should I bring it to your school?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王丽：不用，我还在公交车站等车。啊，我没带公交卡！姐……",
      "traditional": "王麗：不用，我還在公交車站等車。啊，我沒帶公交卡！姐……",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì bú yòng wǒ hái zài gōng jiāo chē zhàn děng chē a wǒ méi dài gōng jiāo kǎ jiě",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: No, I’m still waiting for the bus at the bus station. Ohh, I forgot to bring my bus card! Sister…"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王苹：好好好，再帮你带上公交卡。",
      "traditional": "王苹：好好好，再幫你帶上公交卡。",
      "pinyin": "wáng píng hǎo hǎo hǎo zài bāng nǐ dài shàng gōng jiāo kǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ping: Fine, I’ll bring the bus card for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "王丽：谢谢姐！",
      "traditional": "王麗：謝謝姐！",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì xiè xie jiě",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Thanks!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "王苹：真怕你哪天把自己忘了。还有什么要带的吗？",
      "traditional": "王苹：真怕你哪天把自己忘了。還有什麼要帶的嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng píng zhēn pà nǐ nǎ tiān bǎ zì jǐ wàng le hái yǒu shén me yào dài de ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ping: I’m afraid you might forget yourself someday. Do you have any other things I need to bring?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "王丽：没有了。等等！我的手机呢？我好像忘记带手机了！",
      "traditional": "王麗：沒有了。等等！我的手機呢？我好像忘記帶手機了！",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì méi yǒu le děng děng wǒ de shǒu jī ne wǒ hǎo xiàng wàng jì dài shǒu jī le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: No more. Wait! Where is my cellphone? I forgot to bring my cellphone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "王苹：那你现在用的是谁的手机？",
      "traditional": "王苹：那你現在用的是誰的手機？",
      "pinyin": "wáng píng nà nǐ xiàn zài yòng de shì shéi de shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ping: Whose phone are you using now?"
    },
